The Parley keyboard comes to Android: tap the mic in any app, speak, and tidied text lands in the field; another key switches back to your usual keyboard. Recordings get a Report: timeline analysis, action items, highlights and a scorecard, made on the phone. Filling in a long meeting's transcript now runs in the background and keeps going after you leave the app, instead of uploading the whole recording again. AI titles now match between phone and computer.
